  <h2>Who you are buying from</h2>
  <p><span class="blank">[Trading name, and company number if registered]</span>, at <span class="blank">[address]</span>. You can reach us at <span class="blank">[email]</span>.</p>

  <h2>How an order works</h2>
  <p>Adding books to your basket and sending a request does not complete a sale — it asks us for those books, and we hold them for 48 hours. The agreement is made when we confirm your order and send you the total. Until then either of us can walk away, and nothing has been charged.</p>
  <p>We may not be able to confirm an order if a title has sold in the meantime, or if there is an obvious error in the price. If that happens we tell you and nothing is owed.</p>

  <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
  <p>Prices are in pounds sterling and include VAT where it applies. No card details are taken on this website. You pay by bank transfer, or in cash if you are collecting or we have agreed it.</p>

  <h2>Your books</h2>
  <p>The books remain ours until they are paid for in full.</p>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>Covered separately on the <a href="/returns" class="text-[var(--color-navy)] underline underline-offset-2">returns page</a>, which forms part of these terms.</p>

